# The work-order fixtures and their golden file are compared byte for byte, so they must
# arrive on disk exactly as committed. Without this, the repo-root `* text=auto` plus
# `core.autocrlf=true` hands a Windows checkout CRLF copies and the golden test fails for a
# reason that has nothing to do with the compiler. Caught exactly that way.
#
# Scoped deliberately to these files. The spec-store fixtures next door are LEFT to the
# platform on purpose: their round-trip test is line-ending agnostic by design, and letting
# them arrive CRLF on Windows keeps that claim honestly exercised.
work-order-tree.golden.md -text
work-order-tree/**/*.md -text
